### Describe the bug

As per tc39/proposal-decorators [[Adding initialization logic with addInitializer](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-decorators?tab=readme-ov-file#adding-initialization-logic-with-addinitializer)]
Method and Getter/Setter decorators should be initialised before any class fields are initialised

### Input code

```typescript
const myDecorator = (value, context) => {
  context.addInitializer(() => {
    console.log("init")
  })
  return value
}

class A {
  value = this.getNumber();
  value2 = this.getNumber();
  
  @myDecorator
  getNumber() {
    console.log("getNumber")
    return 1
  }
}

const a = new A()
```


